    `W a2 b2 b3 / B a5 a6 b6` has the same value and a reachable pawn structure. 8×8 FEN with the trébuchet:
    `8/8/pp6/p4Kp1/6Pk/1P6/PP6/8 w` (10 men). This is model-level only, not real-chess certified.
